OL,3,GNEWSAPolice sniffer dogs search high
OL,4,Aschool after 'bomb threat'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice sniffer dogs have searched a
OL,7,Fhigh school in East Kilbride after a
OL,8,Fhoax bomb threat.
OL,10,FOfficers were alerted to a "malicious
OL,11,Fcommunication" posted by an anonymous
OL,12,Fsocial media account on Monday as well
OL,13,Fas "subsequent online messaging", which
OL,14,Fclaimed explosives had been hidden at
OL,15,FCalderglen High School.
OL,17,FThe account also named Duncanrig High
OL,18,FSchool as a possible target.
OL,20,FPolice Scotland said they had swept the
OL,21,Farea with specialist resources but
OL,22,Fnothing of concern was found.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
